\newlabel{lst:sweep}{{A.3}{44}{Parallel bulk simulation. Graph generation and metric computation are distributed across CPU cores via \texttt {ProcessPoolExecutor}; database writes are kept serial to avoid SQLite file-locking errors. Each job receives an independent seed so that results are exactly reproducible}{lstlisting.A.3}{}}
